# Switching the engine in the agent chat (⌘J panel and the Agent screen): applies to the
# conversation from the next message; the default stays in the route in Settings › Agent.
# Revision: AI draft, not yet reviewed by a native speaker.

seletor-motor-rotulo = Switch the engine for this conversation
seletor-motor-automatico = Automatic
seletor-motor-rota = route order
seletor-motor-dica = Applies to this conversation from the next message. The default stays in Settings › Agent.
